Source: https://github.com/flashinfer-ai/flashinfer
Commit: c9f0f0d90a22b1734733297ec09f0f44d21927cf

The local device implementation in csrc/smxx/fwd_kernel_fused.cuh is adapted
from the prefill exports recorded in flash_kda/fused_registry.json.
Local modifications: renamed operands/layouts, consolidated PTX helpers,
parameterized state/head variants, passed TMA descriptors as grid-constant
parameters, and removed disabled serving/checkpoint/tape paths.
The device arithmetic and schedule ordering follow the recorded source family.
Only the H64/H96 benchmark schedule portfolio is retained; generic Direct
N16/N32 cover additional correctness and state contracts.
The scheduling functions in flash_kda/_fused_policy.py were extracted from
flashinfer/kda_prefill.py at the same commit.
